            <ArticleTitle>Robotic mitral repair with sliding leaflet valvuloplasty and remodelling partial annuloplasty.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1093/mmcts/mmw013</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">mmw013</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Complex pathoanatomy that requires posterior leaflet height reduction can be accomplished robotically with excellent surgical outcomes. We report the technique of robotic sliding leaflet valvuloplasty in cases of severe myxomatous degenerative disease with elevated predictive risk of systolic anterior motion.</AbstractText>
